[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.020]   Ladies and gentlemen, thank you for standing by
[00:00:05.020 --> 00:00:08.980]   and welcome to Constellium's second quarter 2020 results call.
[00:00:08.980 --> 00:00:12.200]   At this time, all participants are in a listen-only mode.
[00:00:12.200 --> 00:00:15.160]   Later, we will conduct a question-and-answer session
[00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.560]   and instructions will follow at that time.
[00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.360]   If anyone should require assistance during the conference,
[00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.620]   please press star zero on your touchtone telephone.
[00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.880]   As a reminder, this conference call may be recorded.
[00:00:27.400 --> 00:00:30.240]   I would now like to turn the conference over to your host today,
[00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:33.860]   Mr. Ryan Rantling, Director of Investor Relations.
[00:00:33.860 --> 00:00:35.260]   Sir, please go ahead.
[00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:37.380]   Thank you, Operator.
[00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:41.280]   I would like to welcome everyone to our second quarter 2020 earnings call.
[00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:45.440]   On the call today are our Chief Executive Officer, Jean-Marc Germain,
[00:00:45.440 --> 00:00:48.100]   and our Chief Financial Officer, Peter Maas.
[00:00:48.100 --> 00:00:51.300]   After the presentation, we will have a Q&A session.
[00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:54.460]   A copy of the slide presentation for today's call
[00:00:54.460 --> 00:00:56.960]   is available on our website at constellium.com
[00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:57.380]   and on our website at constellium.com.
[00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:58.960]   And today's call is being recorded.
[00:00:58.960 --> 00:01:02.260]   Before we begin, I'd like to encourage everyone
[00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:03.680]   to visit the company's website
[00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:05.700]   and take a look at our recent filings.
