[00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:11.620]   in the second quarter of 2019.
[00:06:11.620 --> 00:06:19.460]   Adjusted EBITDA of 81 million euros decreased 51% compared to the second quarter of 2019.
[00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:26.180]   With a strong focus on cost control, we are able to offset a significant part of the volume headwinds
[00:06:26.180 --> 00:06:29.620]   of adjusted EBITDA across each of our business units.
