[01:01:34.200 --> 01:01:41.640]   and we're seeing a stronger rebound. And I hope this is coming to us in the U.S., throughout the U.S.
[01:01:41.640 --> 01:01:49.320]   That's great. It's good to hear, John-Marc, and I hope everybody's safe and well over there. Thank you very much.
[01:01:49.320 --> 01:01:50.360]   And good luck.
[01:01:50.360 --> 01:01:53.480]   Thank you.
[01:01:53.480 --> 01:01:57.000]   Go ahead, sir.
[01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:58.360]   Go ahead, Joanna.
[01:01:58.360 --> 01:02:04.200]   Yes, sir. I am showing no further questions at this time. I would like to turn the conference back to
[01:02:04.200 --> 01:02:07.720]   Mr. Jean-Marc Germain, CEO of Constellium. Go ahead.
[01:02:07.720 --> 01:02:14.360]   Thank you, Joanna. So, thanks, everyone, for participating in the call today. As you can see,
[01:02:14.360 --> 01:02:19.160]   we are very focused on facing the crisis, protecting
[01:02:19.160 --> 01:02:23.880]   cash flow, and building a stronger Constellium when things are behind us.
[01:02:23.880 --> 01:02:31.000]   Thank you very much, and look forward to updating you on our progress in Q3. Take care. Stay well.
[01:02:31.000 --> 01:02:36.040]   Thank you, speakers. Ladies and gentlemen, this concludes today's conference call.
[01:02:36.040 --> 01:02:38.760]   Thank you all for joining. You may now disconnect.
